{title: Ole Ole Ole Ole}
{artist: Abhijeet Ye Dillagi}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Jab bhi koi ladki dekhu,
[G]mera dil deewana bole
[Am]Ole ole ole, ole ole ole
[Am]Gaao taraana yaara
[G]jhoom-jhoom ke haule haule
[Am]Ole ole ole, ole ole ole
[C]Mujhko lubhaati hai jawaaniya,
[C]masti lutaati zindagaaniya
[F]Maane na kehna paagal
[G]mast pavan sa dil ye dole
[Am]Ole ole ole, ole ole ole
[Am]Ole ole ole, ole ole ole
[Am]Koi maane ya na maane,
[Am]main hoon aashiq aawara
[G]Main saudai deewana,
[F]mujhko chaahat ne maara
[Am]Ye chikne-chikne chehre,
[Am]ye gori-gori baahein
[G]Bechain mujhe karti hain,
[F]ye chanchal shok adaaye
[C]Mujhko mili hain ye bechainiya,
[C]likho khayalon mein kahani yahaan
[F]Dekhu jahaan koi shama
[G]sang se gayi haule-haule
[Am]Ole ole ole, ole ole ole
[Am]Ole ole ole, ole ole ole
[Am]Main daudta rehta hu,
[Am]yaadon ki rang-raliyon mein
[G]Mere sapnon ka ghar hain,
[F]mehbooba ki galiyon mein
[Am]De dar jaaho peedion ka,
[Am]main bekaabu ho jaau
[G]Rangeen lage ye duniya,
[F]main khwaabon mein kho jaaoon
[C]Maangoon haseeno se nishanyan,
[C]behake shababon ki ravaani yahaan
[F]Husn ka jalwa meri
[G]in aankho ka parda khole
[Am]Ole ole ole, ole ole ole
[Am]Ole ole ole, ole ole ole
